{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39838","headline":"次韵九华杜先辈重阳寄投宛陵丞相 · 殷文圭","name":"次韵九华杜先辈重阳寄投宛陵丞相","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日下飞声彻不毛，酒醒时得广离骚。\n先生鬓爲吟诗白，上相心因治国劳。\n千乘信回鱼榼重，九华秋逈凤巢高。\n强酬小谢重阳句，沙恨无金尽日淘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}